        "text_UBhimV": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "class_name": "shipping-page-text",
            "text": "<p>We currently deliver within Australia and New Zealand.</p><p>Shipping costs are calculated automatically at checkout, based on your order value. Any additional costs will be clearly displayed before you complete your purchase.</p><p>Please provide a valid, accurate delivery address with every order. DTY isn't responsible for delays, losses, cancellations or added charges resulting from incorrect information.</p><p>We deliver via <strong>Australia Post</strong>. All deliveries require a signature on receipt, to a residential or commercial address — we can't deliver to PO boxes or leave parcels unattended.</p>",
