body>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dty-delivery-card\">\n  <h4>International Shipping Costs (New Zealand)</h4>\n  <p>All orders to New Zealand are delivered by Express for $35 AUD.</p>\n</div>"
