        "text_Wrdqkp": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "class_name": "shipping-page-list",
            "text": "<ul><li>For orders being shipped within Australia, prices include 10% GST.</li><li>For orders being shipped internationally, Australian GST is removed from the item price.</li><li>Prices may be subject to currency variations. Import duties will be calculated at the price applicable at the time the order is submitted.</li><li>All international shipping destinations have Delivery Duty Unpaid (DDU) declarations, meaning that any duties and taxes will be payable upon your order arriving in your country.</li><li>For orders to New Zealand, a GST of 15% applies to all imported items or consignments over NZD $1,000. This is imposed by and payable to your local customs office. Payment of these taxes is necessary to release your order from customs.</li><li>Any orders refused upon delivery at their final destination or customs will have the charged shipping fees deducted from the refunded amount and may be subject to a 30-day reprocessing time.</li></ul>",
